				<pubDate>Mon, 03 Feb 2014 14:41:39 +0000</pubDate>
												<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>这是为 SCP 维基制作的主题文件。</p> <p>源代码位于 Github：<a href="https://github.com/scpwiki/sigma9">https://github.com/scpwiki/sigma9</a></p> <hr /> <blockquote> <h1><span>SCP 翻译网站指南</span></h1> <p>要将此主题应用于你的 Wikidot 网站，请遵循以下步骤：</p> <ol> <li>复制此页的所有附件。</li> <li>在你的网站上创建一个名为“component:theme”的页面。你可能会希望锁定该页。</li> <li>将所有附件上传至该页。</li> <li>复制此页上的代码至你的“component:theme”页面上。将所有“scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com”修改为你的 Wikidot 网站 URL 地址。</li> <li>打开你的网站的控制台，前往<strong>外观与表现</strong>，<strong>布景主题</strong>，点击<strong>外部</strong>，然后输入<span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">“http://your-site-name.wikidot.com/component:theme/code/1”</span>。</li> <li>如果你希望使用导航栏的新格式，复制<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/nav:side">侧栏</a>和/或<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/nav:top">顶栏</a>。注意项目图标也在侧边栏页面的附件中。</li> <li>复制<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/main">主页</a>的模版，包括附件。</li> <li>要激活移动端界面，打开你的维基任意页面，点击底端的“+ 选项”。</li> <li>点击“编辑元信息”。</li> <li>点击“新增一个 meta 标签”。“name”输入“viewport”（不带引号），“content”输入“width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0”（同样也不带引号）。</li> <li>完成！</li> </ol> </blockquote> <hr /> <div class="code"> <div class="hl-main"> <pre> <span class="hl-var">@charset</span><span class="hl-code"> &quot;</span><span class="hl-identifier">utf-8</span><span class="hl-code">&quot;; </span><span class="hl-var">@import</span><span class="hl-code"> </span><span class="hl-identifier">url</span><span class="hl-code">('</span><span class="hl-identifier">https</span><span class="hl-code">://</span><span class="hl-identifier">cdn.jsdelivr.net</span><span class="hl-code">/</span><span class="hl-identifier">gh</span><span class="hl-code">/</span><span class="hl-identifier">scp-cn-tech</span><span class="hl-code">/</span><span class="hl-identifier">sigma9</span><span class="hl-var">@cn</span><span class="hl-code">/</span><span class="hl-identifier">fonts</span><span class="hl-code">/</span><span class="hl-identifier">font-bauhaus.css</span><span class="hl-code">'); </span><span class="hl-var">@import</span><span class="hl-code"> </span><span class="hl-identifier">url</span><span class="hl-code">('</span><span class="hl-identifier">https</span><span class="hl-code">://</span><span class="hl-identifier">fonts.googleapis.com</span><span class="hl-code">/</span><span class="hl-identifier">earlyaccess</span><span class="hl-code">/</span><span class="hl-identifier">nanumgothic.css</span><span class="hl-code">'); </span><span class="hl-var">@import</span><span class="hl-code"> </span><span class="hl-identifier">url</span><span class="hl-code">('</span><span class="hl-identifier">https</span><span class="hl-code">://</span><span class="hl-identifier">fonts.googleapis.com</span><span class="hl-code">/</span><span class="hl-identifier">earlyaccess</span><span class="hl-code">/</span><span class="hl-identifier">nanumgothiccoding.css</span><span class="hl-code">'); </span><span class="hl-var">@import</span><span class="hl-code"> </span><span class="hl-identifier">url</span><span class="hl-code">('</span><span class="hl-identifier">https</span><span class="hl-code">://</span><span class="hl-identifier">maxcdn.bootstrapcdn.com</span><span class="hl-code">/</span><span class="hl-identifier">font-awesome</span><span class="hl-code">/4.3.0/</span><span class="hl-identifier">css</span><span class="hl-code">/</span><span class="hl-identifier">font-awesome.min.css</span><span class="hl-code">'); /</span><span class="hl-identifier">*</span><span class="hl-code"> 多重折叠模块 </span><span class="hl-identifier">*</span><span class="hl-code">/ </span><span class="hl-var">@import</span><span class="hl-code"> </span><span class="hl-identifier">url</span><span class="hl-code">('</span><span class="hl-identifier">https</span><span class="hl-code">://</span><span class="hl-identifier">cdn.jsdelivr.net</span><span class="hl-code">/</span><span class="hl-identifier">gh</span><span class="hl-code">/</span><span class="hl-identifier">scp-cn-tech</span><span class="hl-code">/</span><span class="hl-identifier">sigma9</span><sp